  "worked_solution": "The elements of the given set are real numbers that satisfy the equation ${x}^{2}-5=0.$\n\nSo, we first need to solve our equation for $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-5 & =0 \\\\ {x}^{2} & =5 \\\\ x & =\\pm \\sqrt{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe solutions are $x=-\\sqrt{5},\\sqrt{5},$ and both of these solutions are real numbers.\n\nTherefore, we can write the given set as\n\n$$\nB={\\pm \\sqrt{5}}.\n$$",
